              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পদ — pôd — \"a post; a position\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "তিনি অফিসে একটা বড় পদে আছেন। Tini ôphise ekṭā bôṛo pôde āchhen. She holds a senior post at the office."
