          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পদ (pôd) is a tatsama, Sanskrit pada, \"a step\", and from that \"a place, a rank\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
